		{
			"outputs":[
				
			],
			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"### 🔄 Swap DWpose with Other ControlNets and use a custom reference image.\n`Use different ControlNets to change how motion or structure is guided`\n\nYou don’t have to use DWpose — you can swap in other ControlNets and now **use your own reference image** for more control and consistency:\n\n- 🌊 Depth  \n- 🖊️ Lineart  \n- 🧍 OpenPose  \n\n📌 For lip sync or better facial detail:  \nUse Open pose with a **close-up video** and a **custom ref image** for best results.\n\n📌 In the upload image node just upload your ref image and watch it come to life!\n\n"
			],
